      "source_url": "https://idaholookouts.weebly.com/swanholm.html"
    },
    {
      "year": 1929,
      "event": "staffed",
      "note": "William Rafferty went to the lookout in June 1929; the trip took two days by pack horse.",
      "from": "research",
      "source_url": "https://idaholookouts.weebly.com/swanholm.html"
    },
    {
      "year": 1945,
      "event": "staffed",
      "note": "Eula Bibo, who first worked the station in 1921, returned for the summer. Her son John, 16, worked in her place on Sundays.",
